{"name": "GodsTV", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">GodsTV is a 90\u2019s inspired action roguelite, drenched in humor, fame-lust, and chaos. Shoot and slice in fast paced shows, farm aura, craft your build and earn the Gods favor on your ascension to Godhood.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626570/extras_big/6eded97097c68cc32cb84a6d01b8b516.webp?t=1787065310\" height=\"144\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626570/extras/6eded97097c68cc32cb84a6d01b8b516.avif?t=1787065310\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626570/extras/3be5f54e0931e52f7b2674e2ecaca881.poster.avif?t=1787065310\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626570/extras/3be5f54e0931e52f7b2674e2ecaca881.webm?t=1787065310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626570/extras/3be5f54e0931e52f7b2674e2ecaca881.mp4?t=1787065310\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Gods\u2122 of the Capitalypse feed off ratings. They\u2122 demand blood, laughs and drama in exchange for heavenly upgrades. If you want to get far in this show you must gain the ultimate power: Fame. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"272\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626570/extras/ca9bb25e76fe6362cb512fac7114ded6.avif?t=1787065310\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626570/extras/28ace8d8c6bd7e3144d24a3734cfc37b.poster.avif?t=1787065310\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626570/extras/28ace8d8c6bd7e3144d24a3734cfc37b.webm?t=1787065310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626570/extras/28ace8d8c6bd7e3144d24a3734cfc37b.mp4?t=1787065310\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as four distinct playstyles: Kinni, the Stripper Bruiser: Leetah, the Ninja Popstar; Pepperishi, the Pizza Shaman; and V1KTU$, the Gadget Master.\u00a0 Combine your contender with unique Godskins, weapons, and signature moves to create your own fighting style and woo your fans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626570/extras_big/82d3e4e14c633fd002133c3001122316.webp?t=1787065310\" height=\"144\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626570/extras/82d3e4e14c633fd002133c3001122316.avif?t=1787065310\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626570/extras/fe45cbda4861121ac4023eacd9b9f817.poster.avif?t=1787065310\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626570/extras/fe45cbda4861121ac4023eacd9b9f817.webm?t=1787065310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626570/extras/fe45cbda4861121ac4023eacd9b9f817.mp4?t=1787065310\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To earn the endorsement of the Gods you have to get famous! The more fame you accumulate, the stronger the powers the Gods give to you. Please them, and you\u2019ll unlock your star potential with addictive skins, upgrades, and rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626570/extras/132dfaa132e0f6c562cb2b1f052d331f.poster.avif?t=1787065310\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626570/extras/132dfaa132e0f6c562cb2b1f052d331f.webm?t=1787065310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626570/extras/132dfaa132e0f6c562cb2b1f052d331f.mp4?t=1787065310\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Die or win to visit the Backstage! Upgrade your Contenders and craft your build for the next show. Mingle with the staff of the Show: your shady AI-Gent and his shady deals, your jaded star coach, and the rest of the spicy cast. Make friends, enemies\u2026 and maybe even lovers, if you play your cards right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"220\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626570/extras/c1e7397e7f936f169f245b25d20ec634.avif?t=1787065310\" width=\"1024\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "A chaotic action roguelite where you compete for immortality by pleasing clout-obsessed Gods in a combat-filled reality show. Kill & kill again to build a fanbase and earn heavenly rewards to grow stronger. Ascend to stardom by slaying in style!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626570/2de488e3177c127f995195b25d6e20e01b429cfd/header.jpg?t=1787065310", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Early Access", "Action", "Roguelite", "Character Action Game", "Comedy", "Roguelike"], "developers": "Melbot", "publishers": "Melbot", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "2626570", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "14 July 2025 - Demo\n\nhttps://store.steampowered.com/app/3673170/GodsTV_Demo/?curator_clanid=44917508", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/QQuAVARTXaY", "first_seen": 1752444000.0, "review_rank": 1557}